  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Conserving hawksbill sea turtles and their beach habitats in Barbados.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The recipient will conduct all night patrols on the national index nesting beach and other high density nesting beaches for hawksbills June 1-November 30 and once nightly patrols on all other high density hawksbill to collect nesting data and protect nesting females.</narrative>
  </description>
